          }
        },
        "faq_1_1": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is Dockers known for?",
            "answer": "<p>Dockers is an American menswear brand, born in California in 1986 and built around the iconic khaki trouser. It is known for comfortable, easy-to-style clothing (khakis, chinos, shirts and polos) designed to work from office days to weekends. Its philosophy is simple: great style should not be complicated.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_1_2": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is dockers.in the official Dockers website in India?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Dockers.in is the official online store for Dockers in India. You can shop the full men's range there: trousers, casual and formal shirts, polos, T-shirts and plus-size styles. Orders ship across India, you get a 7-day return and exchange window, and customer support is available in Hindi and English.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_1_3": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What can I buy from Dockers India for men?",
            "answer": "<p>Dockers India offers men's casual trousers and khakis, casual shirts, formal shirts, polo T-shirts, crew-neck T-shirts and a dedicated plus-size collection. Most pieces are designed to mix and match, so a pair of Dockers khakis can be styled with a formal shirt for work or a polo for the weekend.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_1_4": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is the difference between khakis and chinos?",
            "answer": "<p>Khakis and chinos are both cotton twill trousers. Khakis are traditionally a slightly heavier fabric in the classic tan \"khaki\" colour, while chinos are usually lighter, sleeker and come in many colours. Dockers popularised the khaki as everyday wear, and today both styles work for smart-casual and business-casual dressing.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_1_5": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Are Dockers trousers suitable for office wear?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Dockers khakis and casual trousers are a business-casual staple. Pair them with a formal or casual shirt and loafers or derbies for the office, or switch to a polo and sneakers for a relaxed look. Neutral shades like khaki, navy, olive and grey are the easiest to style for work.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_1_6": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Does Dockers India have plus-size clothing?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Dockers India has a dedicated Plus Size collection for men, available under the Men menu on dockers.in. Check the size guide on each product page before ordering. If the fit isn't right, you can request a size exchange within 7 days of delivery, subject to stock.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_1_7": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I choose the right size at Dockers?",
            "answer": "<p>Use the size guide on dockers.in and compare it with the measurements of a trouser or shirt that already fits you well. For trousers, check waist and inseam; for shirts, check chest and shoulder. If the size still isn't right, Dockers allows size exchanges within 7 days of delivery, subject to availability.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_1_8": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How should I care for Dockers khakis and chinos?",
            "answer": "<p>Always follow the care label first. In general, wash cotton trousers inside out in cold water with similar colours, avoid bleach, and line-dry or tumble-dry on low to reduce shrinkage and fading. Iron on medium heat while slightly damp for a crisp, office-ready finish.</p>"
          }
        },
        "heading_2": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Orders, Delivery & Returns"
          }
        },
        "faq_2_1": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long does Dockers India take to deliver?",
            "answer": "<p>Orders are usually processed within 1–2 business days. After dispatch, delivery takes about 3–4 business days in metro cities and 5–10 business days in other cities and towns. Delivery may take longer during sales, festive seasons or launches, and the estimate shown at checkout can vary by location.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_2_2": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Does Dockers India offer free shipping?",
            "answer": "<p>Shipping charges, if any, are shown at checkout before you pay. Dockers may offer free shipping on orders above a specified order value or during promotional campaigns. These thresholds can change from time to time, so check the checkout page for the current offer.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_2_3": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How can I track my Dockers order?",
            "answer": "<p>Once your order is dispatched, Dockers sends tracking details to the phone number or email used at checkout. Use the tracking link or number to see your shipment status. Tracking can take a little time to activate after dispatch.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_2_4": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is the Dockers India return and exchange policy?",
            "answer": "<p>You can request a return or exchange within 7 days of delivery. The product must be unworn, unwashed and unused, and free of stains or odours. It must come back with its original tags, packaging (where applicable) and order details. All returns go through a quality check, and items marked non-returnable on the product page cannot be returned.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_2_5": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I return or exchange a product on dockers.in?",
            "answer": "<p>Use the return/exchange option on the My Orders page, or email <a href=\"mailto:customercare@dockers.in\">customercare@dockers.in</a>. Include your order number, product details, the reason for the request and photos if asked. Wait for confirmation and instructions from the Dockers team before shipping anything back.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_2_6": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I exchange my Dockers product for a different size?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. If the size or fit isn't right, you can request an exchange for another available size within 7 days of delivery, as long as the product is unused and in original condition. If the size you need is out of stock, you may be offered a return or refund instead.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_2_7": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What if I receive a wrong, damaged or defective item?",
            "answer": "<p>Contact Dockers customer care within 48 hours of delivery. Share clear photos or videos of the product and packaging along with your order details. Once the problem is verified, Dockers will arrange a replacement, exchange or refund as appropriate.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_2_8": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I contact Dockers India customer care?",
            "answer": "<p>Call <a href=\"tel:+918879660312\">+91 88796 60312</a> or email <a href=\"mailto:customercare@dockers.in\">customercare@dockers.in</a>. Customer service is available Monday to Saturday, 10am–7pm IST, in Hindi and English. Dockers India's office is at Unit 447, Fourth Floor, Kewal Industrial Estate, Senapati Bapat Marg, Lower Parel West, Mumbai, Maharashtra - 400013.</p>"
          }
        }
